    "category": "Mathematics - Game Theory",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "problemStatement": "Starting with an integer N, players alternate choosing a divisor x such that 0 < x < N and N % x == 0, then replacing N with N - x. The player unable to make a move loses. Determine whether the first player wins.",
